# The training notebook writes the exported category classifier here.
# The worker container reads this directory at /app/models.
#
# Artifacts the notebook should leave in this folder:
#   category_classifier.keras   shared BiLSTM, category head and priority head
#   word2idx.json               training vocabulary, padding length, OOV index
#   text_prep.json              cleaning rules the worker must repeat
#   category_labels.json        category softmax order
#   priority_labels.json        priority softmax order
#   evaluation_summary.json     held-out precision, recall, and F1 for both heads;
#                               P1 recall; human-review rate; confidence threshold
#   confidence_sweep.csv        validation threshold table
#
# These export files are kept in git. The Keras file is about 3.4 MB.
